This project depends on open-source software listed in package.json and
src-tauri/Cargo.toml, each under its own license. Their notices are not
reproduced here; consult the respective packages.

Asset icons for Stellar assets are fetched at runtime from the issuer's
stellar.toml (SEP-1) and belong to their respective issuers. Two are bundled
because their published metadata does not resolve: the Stellar (XLM) mark and
the USDC mark, both used nominatively to identify the asset.

